### BullExplorer onApplicationShutdown

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/bull/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/explorers.md

Closes every worker spawned by handleProcessor when the application shuts down.

```ts
onApplicationShutdown(signal?: string) {
  return Promise.all(this.workers.map((worker) => worker.close()));
}
```

